    "description": {
     "value": "<p>Standard-pattern slug-throwing sidearm. Iron sights, six-round chamber, kicks like a polite mule. The most common ranged weapon in Bad Eden — the kind of pistol you find in a glove box, a holster, or the bottom of a trade-post crate.</p><p>No signature, no electronics, no hum. It just shoots.</p>\n<!-- BBTTCC:MECHANICS:START -->\n<hr/>\n<p><strong>⚙️ Mechanical Effects</strong></p>\n<p>Standard ballistic sidearm. No signature ability.</p>\n<ul>\n  <li><strong>Damage:</strong> 1d8 + 3 Kinetic damage to <em>Integrity</em> <span style=\"opacity:.75\">(ballistic)</span></li>\n  <li><strong>Faculty:</strong> Violence</li>\n  <li><strong>Attack:</strong> Firearms (Violence)</li>\n  <li><strong>Range:</strong> 4 / 16 squares</li>\n  <li><strong>Duration:</strong> Scene</li>\n  <li><strong>Tier:</strong> T4</li>\n</ul>\n<!-- BBTTCC:MECHANICS:END -->\n<!-- BBTTCC:LADDER:START -->\n<hr/>\n<p><strong>⟡ Crowned (+3). Keyed to a true name. It will not be sold.</strong></p>\n<ul>\n  <li><strong>+3 to hit and +3 damage</strong> with this weapon (the hit bonus is read from the weapon you swing).</li>\n  <li>Grade raises it to <strong>Tier IV</strong> · soulbound — one bearer, no sale.</li>\n</ul>\n<!-- BBTTCC:LADDER:END -->"
    }
