    "description": {
     "value": "<p>A full-auto handgun with an extended magazine and a folding foregrip — a bandit's gun, a bodyguard's gun, a get-out-of-the-alley gun. It climbs, it chews ammunition and it turns every room it is fired in into a conversation nobody can hear. Faction armouries make them; few issue them.</p><p>Automatic, close-range, inaccurate past a doorway.</p>\n<!-- BBTTCC:MECHANICS:START -->\n<hr/>\n<p><strong>⚙️ Mechanical Effects</strong></p>\n<p>Automatic sidearm. Loud, fast and over quickly. No signature ability.</p>\n<ul>\n  <li><strong>Damage:</strong> 1d8 + 1 Kinetic damage to <em>Integrity</em> <span style=\"opacity:.75\">(ballistic)</span></li>\n  <li><strong>Faculty:</strong> Violence</li>\n  <li><strong>Attack:</strong> Firearms (Violence)</li>\n  <li><strong>Range:</strong> 3 / 12 squares</li>\n  <li><strong>Duration:</strong> Scene</li>\n  <li><strong>Tier:</strong> T2</li>\n</ul>\n<!-- BBTTCC:MECHANICS:END -->\n<!-- BBTTCC:LADDER:START -->\n<hr/>\n<p><strong>⟡ Inlaid (+1). Hex-inlay along the working edge.</strong></p>\n<ul>\n  <li><strong>+1 to hit and +1 damage</strong> with this weapon (the hit bonus is read from the weapon you swing).</li>\n  <li>Grade raises it to <strong>Tier II</strong> · free to wield.</li>\n</ul>\n<!-- BBTTCC:LADDER:END -->"
    }
